@startuml cu40
!theme plain
title CU40 — Modificar tipo de folio

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to modify the name and/or notes of a folio type.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents a list of every registered folio type.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects one and modifies the data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the changes made.
System -> System : System

@enduml